      "label": "former U.S. President",
      "description": "A close-up of Barack Obama, former President of the United States, shown with a somber, downward-looking expression. He is wearing a dark suit, white shirt, and striped tie, suggesting a formal or official setting. His facial expression conveys seriousness or disappointment, which contrasts with the absurd text overlay. This visual is central to the meme's intent, using his recognizable public persona to juxtapose with fictional, humorous content.",
