      "instance_name": "toxicity_1",
      "label": "Harmful",
      "description": "The meme trivializes the office of the presidency and the dignity of former President Barack Obama by associating him with a mythical creature and implying a bizarre, non-consensual narrative. While not explicitly targeting a protected group with hate or abuse, the disrespectful portrayal of a national leader can be seen as harmful to public perception of the office and contribute to a culture of ridicule and disrespect toward public figures.",
